I've already implemented my own version of Stormbringer, and I like it a lot!

1)  Stormbringer is a long sword, and chaotics who dip a normal longsword
    have a chance of getting Stormbringer, and can't get Excalibur. (Neutrals
    get Glossporina, a different blade altogether.)

2)  Stormbringer regenerates you 1-3 hp every time it draws life.

3)  There are no safe-pets or friendly warnings when you weild Stormbringer.
    Stormbringer thirsts for everything.

4)  Being a long sword now, stormbringer does a little more damage naturally.
    Besides, Stormbringer wasn't as weak as you thought.  Stormbringer did
    +5 to hit, +2 and +[drain level damage(1-8)] damage *above* whatever
    enchantment you gave it.

